{"id":"wb-6-402","name":"崇安寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"崇安寺 (陵川)","text":"崇安寺位于中国山西省陵川县城内，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n崇安寺始建年代不详，曾称凌烟寺、福庆院、丈八佛寺，北宋太平兴国三年（978年）敕名崇安寺。寺坐北朝南，现存山门、过殿、大雄宝殿、西插花楼等建筑，为元明清时代建筑。山门为二层三檐楼阁式建筑，歇山顶。过殿面阔五间，进深六椽，单檐歇山顶。大雄宝殿面阔五间，进深六椽，单檐悬山顶。西插花楼面阔进深各三间，也是二层三檐楼阁式建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B4%87%E5%AE%89%E5%AF%BA_(%E9%99%B5%E5%B7%9D)","revisionId":93670495,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93670495","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c95c5b03175bb732dd8d77d6.jpg","title":"20260725_Chong'an_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260725_Chong%27an_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/20260725_Chong%27an_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​晋城陵川 崇安寺","width":320,"height":213}}